            "detailed_description": "DYSTOPY is a hybrid game mixing elements of a beat em’ up action game and a platformer. The journey focuses around Sasha, a young mechanic and her robot R0-X4-N3. In search of Sasha's father the duo will face off against Tekkrat, a sinister corporation, battling against all odds through its countless henchmen and their advanced arsenal.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA product entirely developed in 15 weeks by the students of Campus ADN, class of 2015-2016, within their third trimester as a final school-studio project.",
